  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PCP Kenya 2.0</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The PCP Kenya 2.0 is based on the request letter from Ministry of Investment, Trade and Industry of Kenya dated on 8th April to re-align the PCP to the new Government structure and the new Government priorities such as Bottom-up Economic Transformation Agenda (BETA) and the Medium-Term Plan (MTP) IV 2023-2027. There is therefore a need to take stock, reevaluate and re-orient the PCP to make it fit for purpose and relevant in the new political and economic dispensation. At the same time the PCP serves to align the UNIDO#s activities in the country to a coherent, strategic and effective UNIDO response in Kenya. A focused approach enables UNIDO to concentrate its diverse, in-house expertise and maximize impact in areas key to the country#s industrial development.</narrative>
  </description>
